From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 14:02:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] bundler: support default database context reuse

Add a disabled-by-default root-application bundling policy that emits Convex's existing experimental_reuseContext marker for isolate entries. Keep reviewed exceptions in a centralized reasoned map and fail when exclusions are stale or source output carries a competing marker.

Leave imported components, Node modules, schema bundles, and auth configuration bundles unchanged. Document the operator contract and cover marker insertion, exclusions, conflicts, and stale exclusion paths.
